hones and more in an alternate reality extension of the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet the dev</strong></h2>Help us bring this game to life while we roll out player created servers and factions, new campaigns, open world and bounty systems. Join a really active indie developer accessible both on steam and discord. Our entire dev team is accessible and always online to talk with players and improve the game to make this a notable reference in the hacking genre.",
